/**
 * BIM BYTES — TIME TRACKER + QC ERROR LOG
 * Sheet tabs: Employees, TimeLog, QCLog (+ auto-created tabs)
 *
 * FIXES IN THIS VERSION
 *  - Open session = RUNNING/ON BREAK and EndTime empty (manual edits can't leave ghosts)
 *  - Stale sessions from earlier days auto-close (login + nightly trigger)
 *  - LockService on start/end/break so double taps / two devices can't race
 *  - EVERY append goes through safeAppend_ (trims blank cells and retries)
 *  - New tabs are created small, so they don't eat the 10M cell limit
 *  - fixFormats() keeps durations as text (avoids the ~23 min timezone drift)
 *
 * RUN ONCE from the editor: fixFormats(), setupDailyTriggers(), checkWorkbookSize()
 */

